{"k": "general:02b3762a1ad6804287499f18ee96fc2441fd760abb7272f2755fa831a6c9e0ea", "v": {"text": "To find the **centripetal acceleration**, we use the formula:\n\n$$\na_c = \\frac{v^2}{r}\n$$\n\nWhere:\n- $ v = 20 \\, \\text{m/s} $\n- $ r = 80 \\, \\text{m} $\n\nNow plug in the values:\n\n$$\na_c = \\frac{(20)^2}{80} = \\frac{400}{80} = 5 \\, \\text{m/s}^2\n$$\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer: **5 m/s\u00b2**", "tokens": 125}}
